Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 15:44:29 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] input: Steam Controller (2026) grips play both HD Rumble
 bands (experimental)

Protocol and measurements by iafx (RenHDrum#5, iafx/Lichii); PCM stream found by LiveHaptics (MIT).

Also adds the two new C ABI declarations to externals/renhdrum/renhdrum.h.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 externals/renhdrum/renhdrum.h             |  14 ++
 src/input_common/drivers/renhdrum_pad.cpp | 194 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 208 insertions(+)

